      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "32",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wuzuri ghwa hachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo ichacha, mzuri uchaabonya nguma kwa hachi, na wabaa wibonye nguma kwa hachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula umu wawo uchawuya andu kokimbiria ngelo ya kiremba, kituwirio ngelo ya kikulughulu; wichakaia sa ndoria ra machi ikarenyi na kiju cha igho ibaa andenyi ya isanga jiomie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko meso gha awo wiwonagha ghisechaatungurishwa sena, na madu gha awo wisikiragha wichaasikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo widumbuagha malagho shwa-shwa wichanekwa hikima etanya; na awo wighughumiagha, wichadeda malagho nicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkelu ndechaawangwa mundu wa akili, na wandu wa kisha-kisha ndewichaawangwa wandu wa ishima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkelu wadadeda wukelu ghwake, na maghesho ghake ghadakaia aighu ya wuwiwi. Wadamsholia Mlungu na kuwisigha awo wisewadie vindo wikaie njala na awo wisewadie machi wikaie kau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu wa mikalo ni mmbiwi, wadaghesha malagho gha wuwiwi, upate kumkita mkiwa kwa mikalo yake, hata ngera malombi gha uo mkiwa ni gha hachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mundu mucha wadafunya maghesho mecha, nao wadakaia kwa agho ghiko mecha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Waka wa Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wukenyi inyo waka mwawuyasea kidombo kiduu munisikire; inyo wai mwawuyakuhoresha nideghienyi madu ghenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa ngelo vui isevikagha mwaka mlazi, mchasughusika kwa wowa inyo waka mkunde kukuhoresha, kwa kukaia mizabibu yenyu ndeichaafunya mavalo hata ndemchaapata matunda ghangi gha zabibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, sughusikenyi inyo waka mwawuyasea kidombo kiduu mkikuhoresha; obuonyi inyo waka mkunde kukuhoresha; ruonyi nguwo renyu msigho duu, na kukufunga nguwo ra magunia viwonunyi konyu kwa wasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkukabe-kabe laghenyi konyu kwa wundu ghwa mbuwa renyu rinorie na mbuwa renyu ra mizabibu ivae rimerie kunoneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuwa ra wandu wapo rabukilo ni minjwa na mndandangoma, ee, mrililie na nyumba renyu rerechuloghe ni kuboilwa andenyi ya muzi ghwa maseko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ngome ya mzuri ichasighwa, na wandu werechueghe ugho muzi kukimbia. Mghondi na minara ya walindiri ichakailwa ni nyamandu kwa kala na kala, kuchawuya andu kuboie kolishira weke punda na mfugho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maza richakaia huwo hata Mlungu udie Roho wake aighu kodu, na kireti chiwuye mbuwa inorie na kubusa vindo vingi sa msidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho niko hachi ichakaia kireti, andenyi ya iyo mbuwa ivagha matunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kazi ya hachi ichakaia kureda sere, nayo ichareda wumboa na kurumirikia kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wapo wichakaia nicha isangenyi, na nyumba rawo richakaia na sere, andu kuhorie kwa kima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela vua ya magho ichanona ugho msidu na muzi ghuchanoneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwarasimilwa inyo mchaawa vindo mbai na mbai ya meda ya machi, na kulisha mfugho na weke punda kwa wuhuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
